# Per-release notes drafted by `make release-notes`, edited, then published as the
# GitHub release body via `make release`. Ephemeral — write it fresh each release
# so stale notes are never re-published.
/RELEASE_NOTES.md
# Repo-local release env, sourced by `make release` if present (Discord webhook
# creds, etc.). Keeps secrets scoped to this repo instead of a machine-wide shell
# profile. Never committed.
/.env.release
